+
+Left untouched:
+- Live workspace `E:\boundary-aware-cooperative-transport` on `DBACT-research-v3` @ `795105f`
+- Frozen worktree `E:\dbact-proof-audit-source` @ `98ba28e`
+- Reproduction artifacts under `artifacts/theorem_audit_reproduction_2026-09-11/`
+
+Two different `theorem_mode` meanings:
+1. **This branch (sampled execution):** wall rows, no clipping, mode freeze, abort-on-illegal, hold-segment pair/object clearance, N=16 static audit tooling.
