+# The cargo is an explicit polygon (a U / C channel opening in +y) so the
+# non-convexity is a different geometry family from the L shape.  Vertices are
+# given in world coordinates around (4,4); Cargo recentres to the polygon
+# centroid on load. Max vertex radius from centre ~1.1 m fits inside the N=16
+# ring (radius_min 1.5 m) with the d_min / robot-radius clearance checks.
